Diamond Boy 2 was added in '''Beta 6.6'''. His first change was in '''Beta 13.1''', where he got -1/+1 in stats, going from 3/4 to 2/5.
[[File:Diamond Boy 2 (Beta 31.0).png|thumb|255x255px|Beta 31.0]]
'''Beta 31.0''' did a complete 180 to him, as he now makes the opponent take 2 less DMG instead of you. But due to this negative effect, it did receive great stat increases, these being +3/+1 for +1G, leaving it at 5/6 for 4G. '''Beta 31.2''' brought its HP back to 5.

